@TaskManager.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100

### Register (the REST client keeps the returned auth cookie)
POST {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "developer@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeThisPassword123!"
}

###

### Sign in
POST {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "developer@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeThisPassword123!"
}

###

### Current user
GET {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

###

### List tasks
GET {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=CreatedAt&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a task
POST {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare deployment",
  "description": "Add CI and container support",
  "status": "Todo",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-01T23:59:59Z"
}

###

### Validation example (returns 400 Problem Details)
GET {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?page=0&pageSize=500&sortBy=Unknown
Accept: application/problem+json

###

### Summary
GET {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### Sign out
POST {{TaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
